reg=read(R/'audits/model-registry.json');lines=['# Model and data registry','', 'The milestone names are experiment stages, not one sequential chain of weights. In particular, V4-M6 continues V3-M6; broad-Pt12k is a separate fresh Pt adaptation. New fixed/varied/recovery models all continue that same broad-Pt12k.','', '## Verified checkpoint headers','', '| Checkpoint | Updates in saved stage | Initial checkpoint | Mode / observation | SHA-256 |','|---|---:|---|---|---|']
